{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "af3270b5f01abc594bc12fb9777ecae5c1ee2a7e6c7c5ff4909fef9746c395bf", "ja": "みんなの近況、どんな感じなのかな？\n連絡はたまにしてるけど……詳しく聞いてみようっと！", "zh": "大家最近过得怎么样呢？\n虽然偶尔会联系……还是去详细问问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "14ce5cc5456700109f790740e5d2c53230a87ef19fe74270fddae52e9670478a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n何の話ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n你们在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "a60b832afd3df67f4baca5d35181b4cd7e3c1d6f3f6901e5cc65abf355dc95fd", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n実は今度、プチ同窓会をやるんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n其实我们打算下次举办一个小型同学会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "1c0f41e2e46ba54e5ee84e889c92a3f8dea10319ffb056af7c67b4df437abddf", "ja": "なんだかんだ、集まるのは久しぶりですから……。\n職場のこととか、たくさん話ができたらいいなって♪", "zh": "说到底，大家也很久没聚在一起了……\n要是能聊聊工作上的事，还有很多其他话题，那就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f4f3c3fc5646b6cc8526f8c52a3ce03b9dca63f022f6a713606b9cde9f63d4be", "ja": "なるほど、職場の……となると\n青羽さんも、劇場のことを話したりするんですか？", "zh": "原来如此，是工作上的……这么说，青羽小姐也会聊剧场的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a55c1ed8a4b0807dabc6ee5188df5e7af0d65eeb6c19899ddbab770c5d0e9331", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！　アイドルのみんなは、\nとっても頑張り屋さんで、すごく素敵なんだよ、とか。", "zh": "是的，当然会！比如会说偶像们都特别努力，都是非常优秀的孩子之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e81d4de872e4a76af042ad9a7adc2a4d5f40d570c27cb53d4a56a8613b8e6d11", "ja": "事務所のみなさんも優しくて、毎日楽しいとか……。\nあ、コンプライアンスはもちろん守りますから！", "zh": "事务所的大家也都很温柔，每天都过得很开心之类的……\n啊，当然会遵守合规要求的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "de3026a66113c1b735cc97526a38b38fb05ff6bf652af7e1d92fde489dac7bd9", "ja": "うーん、でも、話したいことがたくさんありすぎて、\n全部話しきれるかなぁ……？", "zh": "嗯……可是，想说的事情太多了，不知道能不能全部说完呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aa92ca0424358fa74f16c84b50827d3c55dff75f33f6e62f8193b47c4098a634", "ja": "はは、素敵な悩みですね。\n話すことがないっていうより、断然いいと思います。", "zh": "哈哈，这是个很棒的烦恼呢。总比没什么可说的要好得多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "96e5cf085a5d6c3a74c52b0a544f5e6629d6dde4855c74085b063b0f14b8fcbf", "ja": "はいっ♪　……そういえば！　社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんを探してましたよ。", "zh": "好的♪……说起来！社长刚才正在找{$P$}先生哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bf6c9b0fb37b189dddf3bd76d05a62f733b102a1429960cb016ab2eae21fe9d6", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？\nわかりました、すぐに向かいます！", "zh": "诶，真的吗？\n明白了，我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "bd824b5603b4d005ab576408ff10d441edeb1db1fc9509a8de17ede4a3e74f25", "ja": "はい、お気をつけて！　いってらっしゃ～い！\n同窓会も楽しみだけど、まずはお仕事頑張らなくちゃ！", "zh": "好的，请您路上小心！慢走～！\n虽然也很期待同学会，但首先得努力工作才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "b28130ce2cb974b2164f755b8b2a4794a74461c6f46a4788e4dfed3397d67d5e", "ja": "いやぁ、懐かしいもんだね。\n私は確か、この辺りに……おお、いたいた！", "zh": "哎呀，真怀念啊。\n我记得自己是在这一带……哦哦，在这在这！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "527ce053738c6e20834ab84545af5737ff51dc52ccc49f3f78fd4f03cc94bf07", "ja": "わぁ、昔の社長、今より色味が薄かったんですね。\nおモテになられたんじゃないですか？　この、この～！", "zh": "哇，原来的社长，颜色比现在淡呢。您当时一定很受欢迎吧？真是的，您这人～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "3f51b4df027bb27c5a0e46486b5f5c0386822356fab69518233e65090cc6a861", "ja": "実はそうなんだよ、音無君。私が暗闇から出てくると、\nクラスの女子はみんな、キャーッと悲鳴を……。", "zh": "其实是那样的哦，音无君。只要我从黑暗中走出来，\n班上的女生全都会“呀——”地尖叫起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1016_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "507dd8bef99dfced198deea76d84913940e89742aad9fb6a57853286f1d1feda", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。\nおふたりで何を見てるんですか？", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了。\n你们两位在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "b3ab6192d3d3a4f688aeabe6687ee5f5921569d26eab0b01e43f0a19b7ab6b0e", "ja": "おお、君。待っていたよ！　ちょうど今、\n私の卒業アルバムを見ていたところなんだ。", "zh": "哦，是你啊。我正等着你呢！刚好现在，\n我正在看我的毕业纪念册。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "b24244c837719895d6fdd3b656c157afbf854bbccd976d9083941364176d9286", "ja": "なかなか面白いんですよ♪\n{$P$}さんもどうぞ。", "zh": "还挺有意思的呢♪{$P$}先生也请看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "607cc391664e9bae206a533759b275567f90d80258f6ed240ee6250eb595907d", "ja": "では、ちょっと拝見して……。\nおおっ！　社長、この頃からダンディーですね！", "zh": "那么，我来稍微看看……  \n哦！社长从那时候起就很有绅士风范了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "66a5cc105953d33334e1fd655461c3bf7a169f50f005cd1a66df3555b0809e12", "ja": "おっと、嬉しいことを言ってくれるじゃないか。\nまあ、三つ子の魂百までと言うからね、はっはっは。", "zh": "哎呀，真会说些让人高兴的话。都说三岁看老嘛，哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7d015b315e42c6fad7712e5883815a10e44f40a56bd25bea6af0ff6fe13014aa", "ja": "ところで社長、青羽さんから、\n探していると聞いてきたんですが……？", "zh": "对了，社长，我听青羽小姐说您在找我，所以就过来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "d075174ae316bed586036e2330a5547d8ef48892eaf07fc521259150969397b4", "ja": "あら？　{$P$}さんには、\n『あのお話』まだしてないんでしたっけ？", "zh": "哎呀？您还没跟{$P$}先生\n提过“那件事”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "9d493b2915f61198e2b88d07f1bc958b3b5b9c83b671e00f337510a6466db655", "ja": "ああ。ちょっとサプライズをしようと思ってね。\nでは、仕事の話に入ろうか。", "zh": "啊，我想给你一个小惊喜。\n那么，我们进入工作正题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "a2d8fdded36d74e6da8fb25a5b7b2ef931d91a2a053945f19d0fdc0c2feb02aa", "ja": "実はそろそろ、天体公演を行っても\nよいタイミングではないかと思っているんだ。", "zh": "其实我觉得差不多也到了\n可以举办天体公演的时机了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d3db97eda3c102df7eec460c0fadba651524466179a278caa4d17c763198bc2c", "ja": "おお、いいですね！　参加できていないアイドルも\n数えるくらいに……って、それがサプライズですか？", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！还没参加过的偶像已经屈指可数了……等等，难道这就是惊喜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "c47ec89035a6ba1183f064893574edf0fad9e8d6b3269ca15cf54e7d4d56b095", "ja": "いや、本当のサプライズは、この企画書だ。\nきっと君も驚くと思うよ！　見てくれたまえ。", "zh": "不，真正的惊喜是这份企划书。\n相信你也一定会大吃一惊的！快看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_1028", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6cb163e393062ced199e69fc1f75f9b7f575850b8a5d31c48d7edf47db23d0e9", "ja": "あ、テレビの企画なんですね。\nええと……。", "zh": "啊，原来是电视节目的企划啊。\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_2001_p", "source_sha256": "1068556642a0a2826ea346ed3107743c3063f11bfb899eee568603393a62ed63", "ja": "ふむふむ……こ、これは……！？", "zh": "嗯嗯……这、这是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "2ec723b854a662608171320b6bfd3a3e4fcb28ee38ca110a07bdbf5de7e9efa4", "ja": "ふっふっふ～！", "zh": "呼呼呼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "2ec723b854a662608171320b6bfd3a3e4fcb28ee38ca110a07bdbf5de7e9efa4", "ja": "ふっふっふ～！", "zh": "呼呼呼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
